	(text "CHARGER: BQ25798 buck-boost 2S charger + power path (I2C 0x6B), PROG 8.2k = 2S / 750 kHz, TS divider 5.23k/30.1k (10k NTC).\nPack: 2 x 18650 with its own 2S protection + balancing on J301. RS301 VBAT (PM1 CH2, bidirectional), RS302 VSYS (PM1 CH3).\nVBACKUP: MCP1703 3.0 V (2 uA) from VSYS -> BAT43W -> P4 RTC_VBAT and GPS V_BCKP; optional CR1220 BT301 (DNP)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 262.89 0)
